    {
      "content": "Yup, absolutely. So first of all a couple of things that separate us from our competitors is we do have a no worries damage coverage. Which is our free evaluation coverage included in our hourly rate, that provides up to $2,000 per move to repair, replace or reimburse for accidental damages. We have another cool perk, it's the meet mover feature. Unlike many moving companies, our movers are not daily contracted workers. They're the most well vetted and professionally trained movers in the industry. A few days before your move you will receive a meet your mover email introducing them to you helping ease attention of strangers arriving at your front door and then finally we do have our on time guarantee we value your time. So, if we can't make it in the time window that we arrange, we immediately start discounting money of your final bill and then I can go ahead and get the details. So I can give you more accurate estimate. Where are we picking up. It's our first location.",
